PN,31301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FSerial sex attacker Simon Levy will
OL,8,Fspend the rest of his life in jail
OL,9,Fafter murdering two women and raping a
OL,10,Fthird, as ITV News Correspondent John
OL,11,FRay reports
OL,13,FSimon Levy has been handed a rare
OL,14,Fwhole life order at the Old Bailey for
OL,15,Fthe murder of two women and the
OL,16,Fviolent rape of a third.
OL,18,FIt means the serial sex attacker will
OL,19,Fspend the rest of his life behind bars
OL,20,Fwith no opportunity of parole.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FDelivering his sentence, His Honour
OL,8,FJudge Mark Lucraft KC described Levy
OL,9,Fas someone who "ruthlessly exploits
OL,10,Fothers for your own personal sexual
OL,11,Fsatisfaction".
OL,13,FAddressing the defendant at the Old
OL,14,FBailey, the judge said Levy was being
OL,15,Fsentenced for a series of attacks upon
OL,16,F"vulnerable women".
OL,18,F"You are clearly someone who
OL,19,Fruthlessly exploits others for your
OL,20,Fown personal sexual satisfaction," he
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@qD@POUsD@MO]xD@AOUxD@RO]zD@AOU|D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FJudge Lucraft KC added: "You are
OL,8,Fsomeone who appears to have a morbid
OL,9,Ffascination with sex, rape and crime."
OL,11,FLevy, 40, was found guilty of
OL,12,Fmurdering grandmother Carmenza
OL,13,FValencia-Trujillo, 53, in March 2025
OL,14,Fand mother-of-four Sheryl Wilkins, 39,
OL,15,Fin August that year.
OL,26,@oD@YOUqD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FHe suffocated both women in sexually
OL,8,Fmotivated attacks, with Ms Valencia-
OL,9,FTrujillo found in a largely abandoned
OL,10,Fblock of flats on the Aylesbury estate
OL,11,Fin south-east London, and Ms Wilkins
OL,12,Fbehind a car park wall near Tottenham
OL,13,FHigh Road, north London.
OL,15,FThe killings came after he subjected a
OL,16,Fthird woman to a brutal sex attack in
OL,17,FJanuary last year in the same car park
OL,18,Fwhere Ms Wilkins' body was later found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FThe surviving victim, who suffered a
OL,8,Fbroken collarbone, told police at the
OL,9,Ftime that she had been raped and knew
OL,10,Fwhere her attacker lived, but she was
OL,11,Fnot formally interviewed until after
OL,12,FLevy had killed twice.
OL,14,FThe jury also found Levy guilty of two
OL,15,Fcounts of rape, grievous bodily harm
OL,16,Fwith intent and the non-fatal
OL,17,Fsmothering of the third woman.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FJudge Lucraft sentenced Levy to two
OL,8,Ffurther life sentences, with minimum
OL,9,Fterms of 12 years, for the two rapes,
OL,10,Fto be served alongside the whole-life
OL,11,Forders.
OL,13,FThe judge said an offence of GBH
OL,14,Fwarranted a four-year jail term, and
OL,15,Fit would have been a two-and-a-half
OL,16,Fyear term for intentional smothering.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FHowever, he imposed no separate
OL,8,Fpenalty for those crimes because the
OL,9,Factions had been taken into account
OL,10,Fwhen deciding the sentences for the
OL,11,Frapes.
OL,13,FWhen Judge Mark Lucraft said the
OL,14,Fstarting point of the sentence for
OL,15,FSimon Levy had to be a whole-life
OL,16,Forder, a woman in the public gallery
OL,17,Fsaid "yes".
OL,26,@yD@FOUyD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
