OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FDuring the murder trial, prosecutor
OL,8,FTom Little KC had said "predatory"
OL,9,FLevy had targeted the three vulnerable
OL,10,Fwomen, all of whom carried out street
OL,11,Fsex work in order to fund drug
OL,12,Faddictions.
OL,14,FThe Metropolitan Police, British
OL,15,FTransport Police and Crown Prosecution
OL,16,FService have admitted failings in how
OL,17,Fthey dealt with Levy, who was on bail
OL,18,Fas his attacks on women escalated to
OL,19,Fdouble murder.
OL,26,@pD@XOUpD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,8,FConduct (IOPC) said it had served a
OL,9,Fgross misconduct notice on a Met
OL,10,Fpolice constable and a misconduct
OL,11,Fnotice on a detective sergeant.
OL,13,FWatch: Double-murderer and serial sex
OL,14,Fattacker Simon Levy is sentenced at
OL,15,Fthe Old Bailey
OL,17,FScotland Yard has also issued a plea
OL,18,Ffor any more survivors of sex attacks
OL,19,Fby Levy to come forward to police.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FLevy's prolific sexual offending
OL,8,Fspanned the period between 2018 to
OL,9,F2025.
OL,11,FHe was previously jailed in 2021 for
OL,12,Fgroping two women in the summer of
OL,13,F2018, one at Notting Hill Carnival and
OL,14,Fthe other at a party in Camden.
OL,16,FEarlier this year, he was convicted of
OL,17,F11 counts of sexual assault in a
OL,18,Fseparate trial at Inner London Crown
OL,19,FCourt.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FLevy was arrested by BTP in November
OL,8,F2024 for sexual assaults on the Tube,
OL,9,Fbut delays in organising an
OL,10,Fidentification parade until the
OL,11,Ffollowing April left him free to carry
OL,12,Fout the rape and first murder.
OL,14,FFollowing Ms Valencia-Trujillo's
OL,15,Fdeath, Levy was released on bail at
OL,16,Ftwo magistrates' court hearings in May
OL,17,Fand June 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FThe Crown Prosecution Service admitted
OL,8,Fthat it had not opposed bail at the
OL,9,Ffirst hearing, and the prosecutor had
OL,10,Fnot given the court all the relevant
OL,11,Finformation for consideration at the
OL,12,Fsecond hearing.
OL,14,FThere were another three Crown Court
OL,15,Fhearings that he failed to attend for
OL,16,Fvarious reasons, yet no arrest warrant
OL,17,Fwas requested.
OL,19,FLess than two weeks after a hearing on
OL,20,FAugust 11, he murdered Ms Wilkins.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FMs Valencia-Trujillo's children
OL,8,Fdescribed her as a "big character" and
OL,9,F"full of life".
OL,11,FShe became a grandmother in 2024 and
OL,12,Fwas said to be a "much-loved" member
OL,13,Fof the community with a love of salsa
OL,14,Fdancing.
OL,16,FMs Wilkins' family said she was a much-
OL,17,Floved woman and was missed every day
OL,18,Fby those who knew her.
OL,26,@pD@TOUpD@bO]qD@AOUqD@NO]tD@ROUtD@]O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FIn a statement read to the Old Bailey
OL,8,Fon Wednesday, Ms Wilkins' sister,
OL,9,FLindsey Hicks, told how Levy has
OL,10,F"destroyed our lives".
OL,12,F"There will never be enough words to
OL,13,Fexpress how I feel since losing my
OL,14,Fsister Sheryl," she said. "You, Simon
OL,15,FLevy, have destroyed our lives...
OL,26,@rD@AOUrD@UO]tD@AOUvD@OO]vD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,F"Sheryl was a beautiful soul who was
OL,8,Fcruelly taken away. This last year has
OL,9,Fbeen the worst year of our lives and
OL,10,Fthe pain you have put us through has
OL,11,Fbeen unbearable... The toll this has
OL,12,Ftaken on my mental health has been
OL,13,Fawful."
OL,15,FShe added: "This verdict is
OL,16,Fbittersweet ` nothing will bring
OL,17,FSheryl back."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@GO]wD@LOUyD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31316
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FThe daughter of Ms Valencia-Trujillo
OL,8,Ftold the court how she has been
OL,9,F"ripped apart" by the loss of her
OL,10,Fmother.
OL,12,F"There's an emptiness that can't be
OL,13,Ffilled," Nazly Johana Fuenmayor
OL,14,FValencia told the court. "I have been
OL,15,Fripped apart... we will never be the
OL,16,Fsame again."
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@NO]tD@AOUuD@HO]vD@ZOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31317
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FDescribing her mother as a "beautiful
OL,8,Fwoman", she added: "She was a truly
OL,9,Fspecial person who gave so much love
OL,10,Fto others. Her kindness, her smile and
OL,11,Fthe love she shared so freely will
OL,12,Fstay with us forever."
OL,14,FThe grieving daughter added: "We have
OL,15,Fbeen living a nightmare we cannot wake
OL,16,Fup from. We don't know why she was
OL,17,Ftaken from us. The rest of our lives
OL,18,Fwill never be the same."
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@FO]pD@TOUtD@VO]vD@^OUzD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31318
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,F"My mum came to this country to give
OL,8,Fher children a better life and for
OL,9,Fsafety. Instead her life was taken so
OL,10,Fcruelly."
OL,12,FIn a statement read on behalf of one
OL,13,Fof Levy's victims, one woman whom he
OL,14,Fhad raped said she thought she would
OL,15,Fdie and she wants to "try to forget
OL,16,Fthis monster".
OL,18,FIn a statement read to court by junior
OL,19,Fprosecutor Kerry Broome, the woman
OL,20,Fsaid she was trafficked into the UK in
OL,21,F2012 and turned to drugs.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@IO]wD@VOUxD@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31319
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,F"I feel like people have taken
OL,8,Fadvantage of me all my life," she said.
OL,10,F"I thought I would die... I want to
OL,11,Ftry to forget this monster... This man
OL,12,Fis a parasite not worthy of any more
OL,13,Fof my words or time."
OL,15,FSpeaking outside the Old Bailey last
OL,16,Fweek, Detective Chief Inspector Neil
OL,17,FJohn, from Scotland Yard, said: "Simon
OL,18,FLevy is a dangerous and predatory
OL,19,Foffender. His crimes were calculated,
OL,20,Fcruel and deeply disturbing.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@]O]rD@AOUuD@UO]yD@aOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/21
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31320
SC,0020
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786576712
OL,3,CDouble murderer and serial sex
OL,4,Cattacker Simon Levy given whole life
OL,5,Corder
OL,7,F"Throughout the trial, he has shown
OL,8,Fcomplete disregard for the victims and
OL,9,Fvictim-survivor, despite being fully
OL,10,Faware of the lasting and devastating
OL,11,Fimpact of his actions."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@WO]
