OL,5,Corder
OL,7,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Kevin
OL,8,FSouthworth, from the Met, said:
OL,9,F"There's a collective system failure
OL,10,Fhere, which has left Levy free to go
OL,11,Fon offending in this awful manner and
OL,12,Fleft these victims at risk from his
OL,13,Fprolific offending, and that's
OL,14,Fsomething which ourselves and
OL,15,Fcolleagues across the criminal justice
OL,16,Fsystem will need to reflect on."
